  text: "Greetings, sir. Jane reporting for duty! As you\u2019ve noticed, I worked
    for the P.L.A. before this, sir! I am more experienced with the extraction of
    hard metals, sir! If my constant use of \"sir\" is upsetting to you then I apologize,
